-- v76.1.6 Cian-only rolling 30-day schedule template.
-- INACTIVE BY DESIGN. Apply only after a separate production authorization.
-- Required Vault secrets: slogi_project_url, slogi_edge_service_role_key,
-- and slogi_listing_cron_secret.
-- The secret value is resolved at runtime and is never embedded in cron.command.
-- Discovery and hydration are separate durable stages. Discovery revisits the
-- hot page and advances one durable backfill cursor page every six hours;
-- hydration drains at most two queued cards each hour.

